WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.560
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.560
"'The sound of splashing surf in my ears...

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'Memories of a hot summer..."'

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.240
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:48.630
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:48.930
Well? Tell me, Okayasu!

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:50.930
Uh-huh.

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:52.660
I'm sorry.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:02.130
"'When Love Hits Rock Bottom"'

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:07.710
What are you saying?
You said you loved me!

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.040
Were they all lies?

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.380
I'm sorry.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.050
Is that all you can say?!

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.720
Why now?!

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:19.810
You're cruel, Okayasu! Why? Why?!

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.420
I'm sorry.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.430
Stupid!

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:49.420
Momo-chan, you're the only one I love.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:53.420
Liar! How can you be so cruel?!
You were fooling me all this time!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.580
l'll never believe anything ever again!

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.430
Adachi-san...

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:00.700
You forgot this.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.700
Thank you.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:06.370
Were you all right yesterday?
You left so suddenly, I was surprised.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:11.040
Did you fight with Okayasu-kun?
He wouldn't tell me when I asked.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.710
It wasn't because of me, was it?

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:19.380
Don't misunderstand! We're just
a former tutor and her student.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.720
Adachi-san, there's nothing
for you to worry about.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.720
By the way, what did you want
to talk to me about yesterday?

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.050
It's all right.

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:32.650
But, wasn't it something important?
We can go to the infirmary right now.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.890
I'm sorry. I'm in a hurry.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.740
l know it's not Misao-chan's fault.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:46.940
But why did it have to be Misao-chan?
She's older, and not especially pretty.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.310
l can't stand myself right now.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.750
Not another fight?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.420
Huh?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.750
You keep avoiding Okayasu.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.360
What this time? Some trouble
with an ex-girlfriend?

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:05.030
It was nothing.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.360
Momo-chan...

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.700
I need to talk to you.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.030
Go and make up!

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.470
Adachi...

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.410
"'You've got mail"'
"'I'm sorry."'
"'Kairi"'
"'Kairi"'

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.260
l can't forgive him...

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:36.260
"'Message sent"'

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.730
No matter how hard he apologizes.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:42.730
lf he didn't love me,
why did he make me love him?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:47.740
lf he was going to put me through
such agony, he should've left me alone!

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:53.410
Swim... l'm going to swim until l collapse...
until my heart is a void.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:56.870
Then l won't have to think about anything.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.690
Here.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.020
Thank you.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:10.360
Seen Kashiwagi?

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:13.030
Sae? No.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:15.930
I figured as much.
She's with that guy again.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:20.370
Is Sae still seeing Okayasu's brother?

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:25.040
Probably. She asked me recently...
to break up.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.710
And will you?

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:27.370
No.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:31.710
Why? She flirted with another guy.
You'll forgive her for betraying you?

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:36.720
Of course, I can't.
But reality won't change.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:41.060
So either I keep seeing her,
or break up with her.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:46.390
It's not about forgiving.
It's about how important that person is.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:50.730
What's important is my own feelings.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.000
Hah! Why am I talking to you
of all people about this, Adachi?

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.900
Sorry to bother you. See ya.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:01.410
What's important is my own feelings?

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:08.680
lt's about how important that person is.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:10.450
My own feelings...

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.030
Momo-chan!

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:19.690
Don't come!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:25.460
I'm sorry! It may sound like a lame excuse,
but I really need to tell you!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:33.710
l can't forgive him.
Seeing Okayasu only makes me angry.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:40.770
lt's useless to talk. So go home!
l'm not coming up until you go away!

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.060
W- what're you doing?!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.180
Momo-chan!

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.390
Okayasu! You can't swim!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.400
Stupid! Get out of the pool!

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.400
Momo-chan!

00:06:57.400 --> 00:07:03.160
Okayasu!

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.380
Okayasu?! Okayasu!

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:20.240
I'm sorry...

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:27.220
Will you listen to me?

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.220
Stupid!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.370
Momo-chan, I didn't
approach you on a whim.

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:44.380
Momo-chan, I was so happy when
you accepted my feelings for you.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.780
But when I realized that you were
serious about me, Momo-chan,

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.720
I lost my confidence.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:56.390
I really love you, Momo-chan.
I really felt we could make a go of it.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:08:00.530
But there were feelings I couldn't get over.

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:03.520
And before I knew it,
I felt myself going back.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.000
Misao-chan?

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.010
Why can't it be me?

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.670
Probably...

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:15.680
Because she was the first one
to acknowledge me.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.740
As Kairi... not as
Okayasu-kun's kid brother.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:41.800
I told you before, all the girls I started
seeing ended up being taken by Ryo.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:48.000
I couldn't stand to see Ryo's face,
and for a while, I didn't go home.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:54.380
I wanted to go to a place where no one
knew me, where Ryo didn't exist.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.050
But Misao-chan was the
only one who was different.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.720
What time do you think it is?

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.660
Huh? Who are you?

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:06.820
Aki Misao. As of today,
I'm your private tutor.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.000
Now sit!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:16.670
I know all about your past. You've gone
through eight private tutors until now?

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:20.340
Let me warn you, I won't
end up like the others.

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.680
--You...
--You address me as Teacher!

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:28.350
You move around in the same circles
as Ryo? Are you after Ryo, too?

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:33.020
Ryo asked you, so you accepted
this undesirable task?

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:36.020
I'll bet you expected someone
a lot cuter than me, huh?

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:39.030
Are you disappointed
that I'm not like Ryo?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:42.700
What are you saying?
You are you, right Kairi-kun?

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:47.030
Of course you're different from Ryo-kun.
You're a totally separate human being.

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:50.440
That was the first time anyone
had said such a thing.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.710
I was so happy, I almost cried.

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:56.710
Misao-chan accepted me just as I was.

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.710
And before I knew it,
I was in love with her.

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.480
I was also glad that
she acted very cold towards Ryo.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:05.720
Misao-chan came just to see me.

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:10.390
And that made me deliriously happy.
But I was wrong...

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:13.360
I realized Misao-chan's
true feelings that summer,

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:16.890
when I tagged along on a club trip.

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.730
Why are you here?

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.070
What's wrong with
one more person on the trip?

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:25.300
Hey, it's time to take a picture!

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.080
Thanks for coming.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.740
What're you saying?

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:32.750
We're here, so let's have fun.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:35.080
That's pretty.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.520
I've never seen you wearing
a necklace like that, Misao-chan.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:41.420
It's nice and feminine.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:42.420
Thank you.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:46.480
Hey there, you two!
Pose for me! Say cheese!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:50.760
Don't slip!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.770
Be careful!

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:55.100
Misao-chan! Hurry! Hurry!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:56.660
Wait... aghh!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.380
Misao-chan!

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:04.040
Are you all right?

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:08.720
Aki... the necklace looks nice.
I'm glad you're wearing it.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:13.720
That's when I knew that Misao-chan
wasn't being cold to Ryo.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:16.090
She stiffened up because
she was so excited to be near him.

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:21.320
That night, she told me
she was quitting as my tutor.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:27.070
And I felt like I'd been thrust aside.
I felt full of betrayal.

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:28.070
"'Hamaya Inn"'

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.900
"'Hamaya Inn"'
I spent the night
walking aimlessly in a typhoon.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:31.740
I spent the night
walking aimlessly in a typhoon.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:35.740
A surfer took me in
and let me stay in his room.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:37.800
I finally went out four days later.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:42.410
I wonder if I'll die if I go out to sea.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.890
Hey!

00:11:58.770 --> 00:12:00.890
What do you think you're doing?!

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:07.840
During the four days I was gone,

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:12.710
Misao-chan had been
searching for me in the typhoon.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:16.310
She ignored everyone's warnings,
and searched alone.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:22.060
If he goes home, don't scold him.

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:25.630
And don't tell him I've
been searching for him.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:28.120
He's a kind boy who worries
about things like that.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:36.400
And that really hit me... That there was
no one else who really thought about me...

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.170
I didn't care who Misao-chan loved.

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.380
Okayasu, kiss me.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.850
Kiss me!

00:12:57.090 --> 00:12:59.520
Do you love me?

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.360
Uh-huh...

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:06.370
But you love Misao-chan more?

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:07.730
Uh-huh.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.700
Stupid.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:24.050
What should l do?

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:28.060
What's important is what you want to do.

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.060
That's right.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:36.730
lt's useless to force Okayasu to choose
right now. He has to decide what he wants.

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:41.790
And l must decide what to do from now.
How do l feel about Okayasu right now?

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.410
See you tomorrow.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.740
Okayasu!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.410
You forgot...

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:52.750
To kiss me good bye.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:53.750
I can't.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:58.420
You're right. A good-bye kiss
sounds ominous.

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:03.690
How about a make-up kiss...
or a let's-get-along kiss?

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.060
Let's be friends and have fun like before.

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:09.700
I was shocked and angry
that you lied to me.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.370
But I understand
your feelings now, Okayasu.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.040
It's all right if you love Misao-chan.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.970
I just want to be near you.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.710
Let's break up.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:30.380
Why? You don't hate me, do you? Then...

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.050
That's why.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:37.390
I'm a guy. And I love you, Momo-chan.
So if you're near, I'd want to kiss you.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.390
That's fine with me.

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.300
Are you serious?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:47.730
What if I take you in my arms, Momo-chan,
thinking of Misao-chan?

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:53.070
Won't you mind? I don't want
to hurt you in that way, Momo-chan.

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.410
That's why I want to break up.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:15:00.680
What are you saying?! Okayasu,
if we break up, I'll cry! I'll cry every day!

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:04.350
I'm saying it's all right!
So why can't it stay the same?

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:08.020
If we keep seeing each other,
I'll make you cry even more.

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:10.850
Because I do love Misao-chan.

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:16.920
I'm sorry.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:22.960
Okayasu!

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.190
Okayasu...

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.380
Adachi!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.390
What're you doing?

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:46.920
Nothing. I'm on my way home.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.400
It's wet.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.070
Adachi... you forgot this.

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:59.410
Oh... thank you.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:02.010
Did something happen with Okayasu?

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.680
Why do you ask? Nothing happened.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:07.350
I think you've been crying.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:10.580
C'mon, I'm not crying.

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.340
What happened?

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:31.770
"'Japanese Language Dictionary"'

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:37.740
Sorry, can you bring it up?

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:43.050
Here.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.350
Be careful.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:50.450
Hurry and take it! It's heavy.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:03.000
Hey! What the hell was that for?!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:07.670
I brought up the dictionary out of kindness.
So why do I have to get punched?!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.300
I gave her up because it was you...

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:30.520
How pitiful... Was that all it was?
Our declaration of love?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:37.040
He made me love him so much.
How can he be so cruel?

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.330
Adachi...

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.130
W- what is it?

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:48.380
Oh... Something's been wrong
with me since yesterday.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:53.990
Oh boy... Why did l have to tell Toji
about me and Okayasu breaking up?

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.060
So embarrassing.

00:17:56.060 --> 00:17:58.220
Did you need to talk to me?

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:01.660
Um...

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.670
I've reached my limit.

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:14.010
I tried to hold back, but I can't anymore.
I can't let him have you, Adachi.

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:17.240
Adachi, come back to me.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.350
Let's start over.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.480
Start over?

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:29.360
Start over with Toji?

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:31.690
Can we... start over?

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.390
One more time...

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.380
I'm sorry.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:54.380
I can't. I can't start over.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.720
Why not? You yearn for Okayasu?

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:02.320
Doesn't he love Misao-sensei?
Then there's no chance for you.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:08.460
How can you say that?
Toji, you switched to Sae and dumped me!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:11.000
Why now?!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:17.000
Do you know how I felt?
How much you hurt me?

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:21.340
It was Okayasu who eased that hurt
and helped me through that time.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.010
Because Okayasu was there,
I was able to get over you!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:29.810
It has to be Okayasu! I love Okayasu!
He's more precious than anyone else!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:36.850
Then why don't you tell him
that honestly, one more time.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:42.030
I was worried about what
I'd do if you really had kissed me.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:48.530
Huh? Did he do that on purpose?
Because l was so depressed?

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.730
Thank you!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:57.600
Okayasu...

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.900
Come with me.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:09.390
About yesterday... about breaking up.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.390
Huh? Yeah...

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:14.990
It's... okay.

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:20.730
Thanks for everything. And I'm sorry.

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:22.740
It may sound strange coming from me,

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.740
but you'll find someone
better than me, Momo-chan.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:29.740
Someone who'll cherish you, Momo-chan.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:31.080
See you.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.750
Okayasu...

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.420
I still love you, Okayasu!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:40.750
I love you, Okayasu! You're so precious
to me! I can't live without you!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.420
So please see me.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.750
Huh?

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.760
Momo-chan, you're not making sense.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.960
It's because you said
you wanted to break up.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.430
So fine, everything that's
happened is done.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.770
This time, l'm the one
who'll do the chasing.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.770
And Okayasu, no matter
how much you don't like it,

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.900
I'm going to chase you
and keep chasing you,

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.630
and I'll make you love me
more than Misao-chan!

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:08.050
No! If you do that, Momo-chan,
you'll only end up getting hurt!

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:09.720
Don't run away!

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:12.520
Okayasu, you just want to
make it easy on yourself!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:14.390
You say you don't want to hurt me,

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:17.390
but you're just afraid to get
deeply involved with someone.

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:20.060
You're afraid of being rejected
and getting hurt!

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:23.060
That's why you can't declare
your love to Misao-chan!

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:29.070
Then no one will ever love you!
You're pushing people away!

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:30.800
Is that really what you want?

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:48.090
I won't let you get away.
Whatever I must do, I'll get you back.

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:50.210
Honestly...

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:55.090
I'm really happy to hear those words.

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:58.430
But if you do that, I won't
be able to stop myself.

00:21:58.430 --> 00:22:03.540
Fine with me! You can
have me anyway you like!

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:05.630
Lock, stock and barrel!

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:10.900
Momo-chan, I do love you!

00:22:14.710 --> 00:22:16.380
As the second best, right?

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:18.110
For now.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:22.060
Second best for now.

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:26.010
But someday, l'll be first
in your heart, Okayasu.

00:22:37.430 --> 00:22:43.440
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:53.120
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:56.120
l become so uneasy.

00:22:56.120 --> 00:23:02.730
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:09.070
Where can we go

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:18.740
where we can all be

00:23:18.740 --> 00:23:21.410
under the same sky?

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:29.750
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:36.430
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:42.770
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:50.110
l just wish that l could be

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:58.040
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:06.060
Ryo-sama! l want to go with you,
after all, Ryo-sama!

00:24:06.060 --> 00:24:11.060
l know... but l can't help it! l love you!

00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:14.520
Next on Peach Girl,
"'Pure Love, Straight Ahead!"'
